    {
      "name": "Decisions",
      "description": "Send a decision only while the job is waiting. action is approve or changes. agent is optional and must match pending_agent when set. A decision while an agent is running returns 409. The copywriter does not stop on its own. The listing approval is pending_agent rules, and that one approval covers the copywriter and the auditor.",
